### 🟡 Medium Findings

| # | Anti-Pattern | Location | Details |
|---|---|---|---|
| 1 | **Poor naming** | All 10 tests | Every test is `MethodName_Works` — says nothing about the scenario or expected outcome. Rename to `Method_Scenario_ExpectedResult` (see examples above). |
| 2 | **Missing edge/error cases** | Entire suite | No negative-path tests. Production code has throwable paths (`UpdatePrice` throws `KeyNotFoundException` on missing SKU) and fragile parsing (`ImportFromCsv` will throw on malformed input). Add: `UpdatePrice_MissingSku_ThrowsKeyNotFoundException`, `ImportFromCsv_MalformedLine_ThrowsException`, `GetProduct_MissingSku_ReturnsNull`, `Search_NoMatch_ReturnsEmptyList`. |

